(* The terms defined in this file can not be extracted by hax at the
moment, thus we provide them here.

Under the uniform-bitstring ProVerif backend, every Rust type collapses
to ProVerif's [bitstring], so we no longer declare per-Rust-type
ProVerif type names.  The standard `rust_primitives::*`, `core::*` and
`hax_lib::*` symbols are already declared by hax's shipped
`primitives.pvl`, which `hax-driver.py typecheck-proverif` loads
automatically. *)
